            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.55

- Reduces idle energy use by stopping repeated fast refreshes for threads that are no longer present.
- Reuses SQLite query metadata and combines recent-thread reads to reduce background database work.
- Keeps existing refresh timings, menus, status indicators, and notifications unchanged.
]]></description>
